  "illIntentAttack": "Attack: the arrow is the height, the number is the damage and S is the damage to your Structure.",
  "illIntentGuard": "Covers up: gains Guard against your next hits.",
  "illIntentCharge": "Charge: gathers strength; its next hit lands harder.",
