  "glossRelated": "See also",
  "glossCardHint": "Press and hold a card to read it",
  "glossGuard": "A shield that absorbs the foe's strike. Each defense covers one height: at the same height it absorbs everything, at another only half. It lasts until the end of the foe's turn.",
  "glossHeight": "Every strike and every Guard has a height: ↑ high, → mid, ↓ low. Check the arrow in the foe's bubble and defend at the same height.",
  "glossDeflect": "If your Guard matches the strike's height and is enough to cover it, you deflect it (化): you take nothing, the foe loses Structure and you gain Breath for your next turn. It also grants a Counter: on your turn, choose a free card, a draw or +1 Flow.",
  "glossStructure": "Every fighter's balance. Strikes with the violet hexagon lower it. At 0, the fighter is Staggered.",
  "glossStaggered": "With Structure at 0, the foe loses their next action and takes double damage until the end of your next turn. If it happens to you, you start your next turn with 2 less Breath.",
  "glossBreath": "You pay for cards with Breath: the number at the top left is the cost. It refills at the start of each turn, and whatever you don't spend is lost.",
  "glossBreathe": "Spend a charge to change your hand, recover Breath or recover Structure. It charges when you deflect, complete a form and end your turn with unspent Breath (three steps per charge, up to two stored).",
  "glossStance": "Horse, Bow or Empty. Each stance changes what your cards do, and some cards move you from one to another.",
  "glossDingbu": "Change stance by paying Breath, once per turn. Tap your stance seal to use it.",
  "glossChain": "The card does more if you play it from the stance it names («From…»).",
  "glossCircle": "If you chain from all three stances in a single turn, you close the circle: you gain Breath and draw cards.",
  "glossRetain": "At the end of your turn you can keep some cards in hand instead of discarding them. Some do more if you retained them.",
  "glossExhaust": "When played, it leaves the fight and doesn't return until the next one.",
  "glossForm": "A sequence of cards played in order. Complete it to unleash a great strike. Defenses don't interrupt it.",
  "glossThorns": "Each of your cards that damages it costs you that much Life (forms don't). It doesn't work while Staggered.",
  "glossRegen": "Before each action it recovers that much Life. If Staggered and it loses the action, it doesn't heal either.",
  "glossFury": "Higher up, the mountain enrages foes: after each action their strikes add a little more, and it never calms. Holding out isn't enough: beat them fast. When Staggered, the foe loses the action and doesn't grow angrier that turn.",
  "glossWrath": "After each action its strikes add that much damage, and it stacks. Staggering it puts it back to sleep.",
  "glossParry": "The first damaging strike each turn deals it no damage and sends a little back to you. It doesn't work while Staggered.",
  "glossSteal": "Each strike that damages you steals jade. If it escapes, it takes it; if you beat it, you get it back.",
  "glossScales": "Each strike loses that much damage, unless the foe is Staggered. Each time you stagger it, it loses a scale.",
